sequenceDiagram

participant User
participant Portal as Cloud Journey Portal
participant Backend as Cloud Journey Backend
participant Agent as Agent Runtime
participant MCP as MCP Server
participant GCP as GCP Services


User->>Portal: Login using Schwab SSO

Portal->>Backend: Send authenticated user context

Backend->>Agent: Create agent session\n(user_id, journey_id)

Agent->>MCP: Request tool execution

MCP->>Backend: Validate user authorization

Backend->>GCP: Use workload identity/service identity

GCP-->>Backend: Return authorized data

Backend-->>MCP: Tool response

MCP-->>Agent: Structured result

Agent-->>User: Explain result